1. curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh

2. Once installed, run:

ollama run gemma4

--> the command above will grab a default-sized version and drop you into a chat prompt. For a specific size:

ollama run gemma4:2b      # smallest, runs on almost anything
ollama run gemma4:4b
ollama run gemma4:26b     # MoE, needs a decent consumer GPU
ollama run gemma4:31b     # dense, workstation-class GPU

